n  note.text ||\\n  note.body;\\n```\\n\\n#### What PR #358 Appears to Have Done\\n\\nBased on the current state, PR #358 likely added:\\n- Debug logging to company notes formatter (lines 20-26, 36-46)\\n- The comprehensive test suite for the content extraction issue\\n\\n**But it did NOT implement the actual fix in the production formatters.**\\n\\n#### Issue #365 Needs No Updates\\n\\nThe original issue description remains **100% accurate**:\\n- \u2705 Root cause analysis is correct\\n- \u2705 Proposed solution matches test implementation  \\n- \u2705 Both formatters still affected\\n- \u2705 Impact assessment still valid\\n\\n#### Recommendation\\n\\n**No updates needed to issue #365**. The issue should remain open and can be implemented as originally described. The test infrastructure is already in place, making implementation straightforward.\\n\\nThe real question is: Why wasn't the fix implemented when the tests were written? This suggests the work was partially completed but not finished.\\n\\n---\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"claude[bot]\",\"id\":209825114,\"node_id\":\"BOT_kgDODIGtWg\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1236702?v=4\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/apps/claude\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"type\":\"Bot\",\"site_admin\":false,\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/claude%5Bbot%5D\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/claude%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/claude%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/claude%5Bbot%5D/followers\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/claude%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/claude%5Bbot%5D/orgs\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/claude%5Bbot%5D/received_events\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/claude%5Bbot%5D/repos\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/claude%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscr