ote content\\n\\n#### **Current Universal Tool Coverage**\\n\\n**Core Operations (8 tools):**\\n- `search-records`, `get-record-details`, `create-record`, `update-record`, `delete-record`\\n- `get-attributes`, `discover-attributes`, `get-detailed-info`\\n\\n**Advanced Operations (5 tools):**\\n- `advanced-search`, `search-by-relationship`, `search-by-content`, `search-by-timeframe`, `batch-operations`\\n\\n**Missing Functionality:**\\n- **Notes retrieval/display** (`get-company-notes`, `get-person-notes`)\\n- **Notes creation** (`create-company-note`, `create-person-note`)\\n\\n#### **Issue Status: INVALID DUE TO ARCHITECTURE CHANGE**\\n\\n**The original issue #365 is no longer relevant because:**\\n\\n1. **The problematic tools don't exist anymore** - `get-company-notes` is not available when universal tools are active\\n2. **Users can't encounter the \\\"No content\\\" bug** - because the tool that causes it isn't exposed\\n3. **The field structure mismatch issue is bypassed** - since there's no tool to display note content\\n\\n#### **New Issue Required**\\n\\nThe real issue is now: **\\\"Universal tools missing notes management functionality\\\"**\\n\\n**Missing capabilities:**\\n- Cannot retrieve and display company/person notes\\n- Cannot create new notes for companies/people  \\n- Only can search records BY notes content, but can't see the notes themselves\\n\\n#### **Recommendation**\\n\\n**Close issue #365** as obsolete due to architecture change.\\n\\n**Create new issue:** \\\"Add notes management to universal tools\\\" with:\\n- `get-notes` universal tool (replace get-company-notes, get-person-notes)\\n- `create-note` universal tool (replace create-company-note, create-person-note) \\n- Proper content field handling (implementing the fix from original issue #365)\\n\\n---\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"claude[bot]\",\"id\":209825114,\"node_id\":\"BOT_kgDODIGtWg\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1236702?v=4\",\"html_url\":\"https://githu