 **Blocked**: 17 issues\\n\\n### Key Findings:\\n\\n#### 1. Critical Bug Ready for Immediate Action\\n**Issue #365 (This Issue)** - Notes content field mismatch\\n- **Status**: `priority:high`, `status:ready`, actively discussed\\n- **Impact**: Users cannot see note content in production\\n- **Effort**: Low (formatter update)\\n- **Recommendation**: Address immediately as next sprint priority\\n\\n#### 2. Post-Universal Tools Rollout Strategy Needed  \\n**Issue #364** - Universal tools rollout strategy (P1)\\n- **Context**: Universal tools implemented but need production rollout plan\\n- **Dependency**: Should follow #365 fix to avoid multiple deployments\\n\\n#### 3. Documentation Debt\\n**Issues #137, #67** - Both P1 documentation improvements\\n- **Impact**: Developer experience and adoption\\n- **Timing**: Can be parallelized with bug fixes\\n\\n#### 4. Testing Infrastructure Gaps\\n**Multiple issues** (#111, #114, #116, #117, #118) - All blocked, part of TDD milestone\\n- **Status**: 17 issues marked as `status:blocked`\\n- **Assessment**: Many blocked issues appear to be artificially blocked and could be unblocked\\n\\n## Immediate Recommendations for Next Sprint\\n\\n### Week 1-2: Critical Bug Fix \\u0026 Rollout\\n1. **Fix #365** - Notes content field structure (2-3 days)\\n2. **Implement #364** - Universal tools rollout strategy (1 week)\\n\\n### Week 3-4: Documentation \\u0026 User Experience  \\n3. **Address #137** - Documentation restructuring\\n4. **Work on #67** - API usage documentation with examples\\n\\n### Strategic Recommendations\\n\\n#### Issue Consolidation Opportunities\\n- **Deals Integration**: Issues #54, #55, #351 all relate to Deals API\\n  - **#351** provides strategic analysis and simplified implementation approach\\n  - Recommend prioritizing #351 over the older issues\\n\\n#### Blocked Issues Assessment\\n- **Many testing issues artificially blocked**: Issues #111, #114, #116, #117, #118\\n- **Recommendation**: Review blocking rationale, many could be unblocked and worked on\\n\\n#### Priority Adjustments Needed\\n- **Issue #351** (Deals Integration) - Well-researched strategic issue, consider upgrading from P2\\n- **Testing issues** - Multiple P3 testing issues could be consolidated under #111\\n\\n### Dependencies and Sequencing\\n1. **#365** \u2192 **#364** (Universal tools rollout after bug fix)\\n2. **#364** \u2192 **#351** (Deals integration after universal tools stable)\\n3. **#137** + **#67** can run parallel to technical work\\n\\n### Success Metrics for Next Sprint\\n- [ ] Notes content visible in production (#365)\\n- [ ] Universal tools rolled out with monitoring (#364)\\n- [ ] Documentation structure improved (#137)\\n- [ ] Blocked issues reviewed and unblocked where appropriate\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Next Action**: Prioritize Issue #365 for immediate implementation, followed by universal tools rollout strategy (#364).\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"kesslerio\",\"id\":2647990,\"node_id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NDc5OTA=\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2647990?v=4\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/kesslerio\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"type\":\"User\",\"site_admin\":false,\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/kesslerio\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/kesslerio/events{/privacy}\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/kesslerio/following{/other_user}\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/kesslerio/followers\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/kesslerio/gists{/gist_id}\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/kesslerio/orgs\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/kesslerio/received_events\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/kesslerio/repos\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/kesslerio/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/kesslerio/subscriptions\"},\"reactions\":{\"total_count\":0,\"+1\":0,\"-1\":0,\"laugh\":0,\"confused\":0,\"heart\":0,\"hooray\":0,\"rocket\":0,\"eyes\":0,\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/kesslerio/attio-mcp-server/issues/comments/3157453813/reactions\"},\"created_at\":\"2025-08-06T05:27:39Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-08-06T05:27:39Z\",\"author_association\":\"OWNER\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/kesslerio/attio-mcp-server/issues/comments/3157453813\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/kesslerio/attio-mcp-server/issues/365#issuecomment-3157453813\",\"issue_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/kesslerio/attio-mcp-server/issues/365\"}]"
